# Data files
# NOTE: data/ holds scraped papers, generated briefings, and USER UPLOADED
# images (incl. medical photos — L3 private data). Only keep .gitkeep markers;
# never commit actual data content. See AGENTS.md "User Privacy & Data Security".
data/raw/*.json
data/processed/*.json
data/exports/*
data/weekly/*
data/fulltext/*
data/briefings/*
data/uploads/*
data/vasi_diagnostic/*
!data/raw/.gitkeep
!data/processed/.gitkeep
!data/exports/.gitkeep
!data/weekly/.gitkeep
!data/fulltext/.gitkeep
!data/briefings/.gitkeep
!data/uploads/.gitkeep
!data/vasi_diagnostic/.gitkeep

